<title>USA: Allegheny seeks GPU repairs to power lines.</title>
<headline>Allegheny seeks GPU repairs to power lines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allegheny Electric Cooperative Inc is pushing GPU Inc to repair the transmission and distribution facilities that deliver power to Allegheny's member cooperatives in Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>&quot;We feel they are not meeting their obligations,&quot; Allegheny spokesman Perry Strambaugh said Monday, adding &quot;It's affecting GPU customers too.&quot;</p>
<p>He said an estimated $15-20 million would be needed to repair rotting power poles, wires and broken crossarms.</p>
